645107448168791_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SqPPb3Q1lFsQ7kNvwH1Gloc&_nc_oc=Adro05HiM8ODrnIzR93a9vRyb1MB7P9ZwcJHZMuHUe7PPDJBUI8vWjwR6rGV2tXn4iI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK22uqkQv0zPja3JHLA9G9HjI25bH5smNthbHCtCMQJwQ&oe=6AAD5627"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Kinetic Surge VR", "keywords": ["telekinesis", "shooter", "survival", "scifi", "arcade"], "long_description": "Unleash raw telekinetic power.\n\nIn Kinetic Surge VR you don't touch what you fight \u2014 you command it. Reach out, grip a floating object from across the dark arena, pull it to your hand, then flick to HURL it at the waves of hostile drones closing in. Two-handed: each hand seizes, holds, and throws on its own, so you can have two objects screaming through the void at once.\n\nSurvive the onslaught. Drones advance from the dark; smash them mid-air before they breach your energy core. Chain your kills for a x2 / x4 / x8 multiplier, ride the combo, and climb the leaderboard. Push your luck across Easy, Normal, and Hard as the swarm grows faster and thicker every wave.\n\nFEATURES\n\u2022 Telekinetic grab-and-throw combat \u2014 point, grip, pull, hurl\n\u2022 Dual-wield force \u2014 two hands, two objects in flight\n\u2022 Endless escalating drone waves with a combo multiplier\n\u2022 Three difficulty tiers + best-score progression and coins\n\u2022 A glowing, dark sci-fi arena built for standing-room VR\n\nNo motion sickness: you stand your ground and let the arena come to you.", "short_description": "Kinetic Surge VR is telekinesis-powered combat. Seize floating objects with a force grip and hurl them at escalating waves of hostile drones. Seize. Hurl. Survive."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kinetic-surge-privacy.pages.dev/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NVR Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://kinetic-su